<title>USA: Graham Corp FY 97 net increases.</title>
<headline>Graham Corp FY 97 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>BATAVIA, N.Y. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to March 31		     1997		   1996</p>
<p> Sales				 $14,328,000	  $11,671,000</p>
<p> Net Income				653,000		364,000</p>
<p>Share Earnings:</p>
<p>   Net Income				  .40		    .23</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding	1,619,000	    1,606,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the 1997 quarter ended March 31 constitutes a short fiscal year in order to accommodate the company's change from reporting its earnings on the basis of the calendar year to a fiscal year ending March 31.</p>
<p>Graham's 1997-98 fiscal year began on April 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
